{"id":"Wc4f315dd5b30979e18959bdc","zh":"轨道交通基础设施","en":"","name":"轨道交通基础设施","language":"zh","domain":"环境振动与轨道减振","concept_id":"C4eb84b6d4ee7ffe7129c","families":[],"definition_zh":"轨道交通线路及相关支承、建造和运营基础设施的统称。","definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":null,"usage_overview":null,"translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"Wc4f315dd5b30979e18959bdc","text":"轨道交通基础设施","language":"zh","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"S5802c8b9b3b29c257cdb","source_id":"P138","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"zh","text":"随着我国轨道交通建设存量的不断增加,相应的养护维修增量不断扩大,导致我国轨道交通基础设施从“建设为主”向“建养并重”和“智能化”转变.","citations":[{"source_id":"P138","page":1,"page_end":1}]},{"id":"S18055f1b858107be2f4c","source_id":"P138","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"zh","text":"因此,轨道交通行业应与物联网、大数据、云计算、人工智能等战略性产业深度融合,实现轨道交通基础设施全寿命周期内智能检测、诊断、智慧管理、绿色养维.","citations":[{"source_id":"P138","page":1,"page_end":1}]}],"sources":{"P138":{"id":"P138","title":"轨道交通基础设施服役性能智能评定与健康管理","authors":"毛建锋；余志武；徐磊","year":"2025","doi":"10.6052/1672-6553-2024-123","journal_citation":"动力学与控制学报","label":"毛建锋等（2025）"}},"relations":[],"related_terms":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"suggested_comparisons":[],"contexts":[],"word_links":[{"id":"W0c53b63255a1ec28c0247ee8","name":"rail transit infrastructure","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"参考译法","reason":null}],"expression_links":[{"id":"W0c53b63255a1ec28c0247ee8","name":"rail transit infrastructure","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"参考译法","reason":null}],"same_language_synonyms":[],"cross_language_equivalents":[{"id":"W0c53b63255a1ec28c0247ee8","name":"rail transit infrastructure","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"参考译法","reason":null}],"related":[],"related_sources":[{"id":"P138","title":"轨道交通基础设施服役性能智能评定与健康管理","authors":"毛建锋；余志武；徐磊","year":"2025","doi":"10.6052/1672-6553-2024-123","journal_citation":"动力学与控制学报","label":"毛建锋等（2025）"}]}